{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026C4aeb2UDXi1794366852.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>涉嫌管有性虐兒童物品的英國哈里王子岳父馬克爾由於剪斷電子監測裝置，被法官下令還柙。</p><p></p><p>82歲的馬克爾，是哈里王子妻子梅根的父親。當局早前在他租用的洛杉磯儲存倉，檢獲近80件涉及性虐兒童物品。聯邦調查局上周五在佛羅里達州的護老中心，將馬克爾帶走調查，數小時後將他釋放。</p><p></p><p><p><img alt=\"PICTURE J.CNN.US.MEGHAN-0801-.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026wzp9H60f5V1794359833.png?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p></p><p>到了當地周二凌晨，美國檢察部門發現馬克爾剪斷腳踝上的電子監測裝置，之後將他拘捕。佛州法官下令將馬克爾押返拘留所，不得保釋，並指示相關部門鑑定他的精神狀況。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-11T03:31:29.678159+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":210,"images":2,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-11T01:15:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-11T07:38:42.616905+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-11T03:24:54.618280+00:00","content_hash":"d7a62582da08869540b7bbbb406136bce52d314c5f035a65dcf05e2d62521209","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}